    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> Inferno Style, Training (3) and Expertise (3) in Melee Weapons or Ranged Weapons, 5 abilities with the Inferno Style trait, and you must receive training from a master of this style, or have access to their teachings</p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> 3 Focus</p><p><strong>Range:</strong> 1-2 Space Radius</p><p>You are the Flame, and you will burn all around you to ash.</p><p>As an <strong>Action</strong>, spend <strong>-3 Focus</strong> and make an attack with a <strong>Melee</strong> or <strong>Ranged</strong> weapon against <strong>every</strong> other creature within <strong>1 Space</strong> of you.</p><p>You may choose to end <strong><em>Inferno Style</em></strong> after you perform this ability. If you do, the range expands to <strong>2 Spaces.</strong></p>",
